      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s elevation directs water flow toward Hominy Creek and the French Broad River, while Candler Knob rises 4,548 feet nearby.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
